  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ANU - Strengthening resilience and supporting recovery in Antigua and Barbuda - Covid-19 Response Health Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;This project is aimed at enhancing capacity of Antigua and Barbuda to mitigate the direct and indirect impacts of the COVID-19 pandemic on the population&#x2019;s health.

The proposed project consists of the following components:
Component 1: Goods
(a) Improving case detection and limiting the transmission of COVID-19;
(b) Strengthening the capacity for the delivery of critical care services to COVID-19 and non-
COVID-19 affected persons; and
Component 2: Other Services
(a) Project Management and Auditing Services and other Project Management Costs&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
